comments.body:
@skyfire-ankit I agree with you that the use of WWW-Authenticate without a corresponding use in the Authenticate parameter would confuse people.  I'd like us to talk about this during IIW, including possibly getting feedback and ideas from others there.  However, that means that this will happen after Monday's IETF submission deadline.

That's not the end of the world.  We can always publish an updated version once we think we have it right.

Therefore, I suggest that we keep the changes to the Intro and merge them by Monday and take out the changes to 6.3 for the short term.
